{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_001_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3339a81e4b182d45523041f165ed2f3e498774998f7f2a6a6d7c3372724df182", "ja": "（色々な場所で39プロジェクトのアイドルを探してる\nけど……はぁ、なかなかいい子に出会えないな）", "zh": "（跑了好多地方寻找39PROJECT的偶像，\n但是……唉，就是找不到适合的女孩。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_001_1001_se", "source_sha256": "b05e7b6975dc0274376bb7d7b51470df5dcf82534b717051e3cdc77831df5eda", "ja": "キーン！", "zh": "铿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_001_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "ba6ecb2964d3c70a213086b6f073dc789a268da0beeec05f2a996db0188dc762", "ja": "うわっ！？\n人がいる方にボールが飛んでって……！", "zh": "哇！？\n球飞过去的方向有人……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_001_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "7cf4462118d8ccdbaf35902a5e174ee60cd25daa48e7f2f82849b34b26c2cb61", "ja": "おーい、そこの人、大丈夫か！？\nボール、当たってないか～！", "zh": "喂──那位先生，你没事吧！？\n球有砸到你吗～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_001_1004_p", "source_sha256": "9c8033d4b06bcb6c1520ab9b3c282ed6eeff2c53db19e1f4a44aaed4e34552d0", "ja": "ん、ボール？　……ああ、これか。\n大丈夫！　当たってないぞ～！", "zh": "嗯？球……哦哦，这颗球吗？\n我没事！没被砸到～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_001_1005_047sub", "source_sha256": "dac7fe6c6fb674a37bbf1895e6b69aba3a4ff56a7b4d937888d1c2a11c12c7f1", "ja": "よかった～。ごめんな、思いっきり\nファウルしちゃってさ。ケガがなくてよかったよ。", "zh": "太好了～抱歉，都怪我用力敲了支界外。\n幸好你没受伤。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_001_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "07dc488f351a439700113b36591707d76dfa2ffabd01b84f581803ae498f2db8", "ja": "あんた、こんなとこにいたら危ないぞ。\nそれより、何してるんだ？", "zh": "先生，你待在这里很危险喔。\n话说，你在这里干嘛啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_001_1007_p", "source_sha256": "4f20b268ed47044416d17432e1e8c0a49a35da506944162a2e759b784b0043f5", "ja": "俺はアイドルのプロデューサーなんだけど、\nスカウトで疲れちゃって。今は休憩中なんだ。", "zh": "我是偶像制作人，四处寻找偶像。\n因为累了所以正在休息。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_001_1008_047sub", "source_sha256": "e84f354b061939d8348cf94a834f320305cbbb2832f56ac5adaba7b1305a131e", "ja": "アイドルのプロデューサー！？　す、すげー！\nオレ、そんな人、初めて見たよ！", "zh": "偶像制作人！？好、好强哦──！\n我第一次遇见像你这样的人耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_001_1009_047sub", "source_sha256": "ab4b392ce2ec172c00474bcf4e63b1a09e55cabc800b7fe4fdc1925558952292", "ja": "どうしよう、サインもらおうかな……！\nあ、オレ、永吉昴っていうんだ！　よろしくな♪", "zh": "怎么办？我该要签名吗……？\n啊，我叫做永吉昴！请多指教♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_001_1010_p", "source_sha256": "1953cd43d76ad4f88ac5e6ca8129e4892f2b81071fe6852996ee07aa0b85046d", "ja": "いや、俺がアイドルなわけじゃないから、\nサインなんてしても……って、あれ？", "zh": "冷静点，我不是偶像，\n跟我要签名也没用……咦？等等？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_001_1011_p", "source_sha256": "94d923d50d97cead4aa90ec467b53b6495fec1cb31f5c1619597ceb02e7c5327", "ja": "（この子……最初は男の子かと思ったけど、\nこの声の高さは……女の子じゃないか？）", "zh": "（这孩子……一开始我以为是男生，\n但她的声音这么高……居然是女生吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_001_1012_047sub", "source_sha256": "269e776795700bc17449635e5d2d85c39cdbb456f9f55ab5740495cfdc44fa60", "ja": "兄ちゃんがアイドル好きなんだけどさ、\nオレも好きなんだ！　アイドルって、可愛いよな！", "zh": "我哥哥很喜欢偶像，\n我也很喜欢哦！偶像都很可爱呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_001_1013_047sub", "source_sha256": "ec5a700ecaa084f4c394dba136800b35d2dee1bb1e0acda1d688dd476bd54d0a", "ja": "この前もテレビ観て、みんなで一緒に踊ったんだぜ！\nへへっ、どう？　けっこう、キマってるだろ♪", "zh": "之前在电视看到，我们大家还一起跟着跳！\n嘿嘿，怎么样？我跳得很不错吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_001_1014_p", "source_sha256": "8d0a340a535dc930d6d2c8b15394478a6c11221769e30808789b7b8c907cec3f", "ja": "（ボーイッシュで男の子っぽいけど、笑顔が愛らしい。\nダンスもできるし、いいアイドルになるんじゃ……）", "zh": "（虽然有点中性，但她的笑容非常可爱。\n而且也会跳舞，好像能成为不错的偶像……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_001_1015_p", "source_sha256": "f7533a6b30d3a629e4103ba921d9e1ffcaa9b3e72459165a2c1b8c95c82fd553", "ja": "えっと、永吉昴さん、だっけ。君……。", "zh": "呃，你叫做永吉昴，对吧？你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_001_1016", "source_sha256": "af64cb5745e12f46015965a25065eec951dbf0fe41fc1cee6cc18e96b64fe4f6", "ja": "名刺を取り出す", "zh": "拿出名片", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_001_2000_p", "source_sha256": "bcea15143e884090c3c9d39bfb6356874fba9100e45cddf0b55573601c435cca", "ja": "アイドル、やってみないか？", "zh": "要不要试试看当偶像呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_001_2001_047sub", "source_sha256": "12dd0d59f7bad9b9afde25d2969335693d99ba807f34b5dd69a9901b7496399b", "ja": "え？　……ええ～～っ！？\nお、オレがアイドル～！？", "zh": "咦……什么～～！？\n我、我去当偶像～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_001_2002_p", "source_sha256": "e5fbb1e3833647222a5019a4c873aea37c78036aeb58cdaff4a103f1e9cc8ef7", "ja": "うん。アイドル好きだって言ったよな？", "zh": "嗯，你不是说很喜欢偶像吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_001_2003_047sub", "source_sha256": "ce0dbb7d8df18963a6a20cb8224a923ade1693d46ba3bcd95ad6b59adf2601ad", "ja": "そ、そりゃ好きだけど……待ってくれよ！\nいきなりそんなこと言われても……。", "zh": "我、我是很喜欢没错……先等一下！\n你问得太突然了啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_001_2004_p", "source_sha256": "c1885693039cd2bffaf25af401b4cfada4856d6a0e232b4ba3f7e2f2a10f6fb0", "ja": "急な話だと思うけど、真剣なんだ。\n考えてみてくれないか？", "zh": "的确有点突然，但我是认真的。\n你可以考虑看看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_001_2005_047sub", "source_sha256": "9e5d3b09ce1210bf6e7c32c2f2ebea5c821ffb968a4f98a07976e573d0cd7d3b", "ja": "う……わ、わかったよ……。\nじゃあ、オレから連絡する！　だから、考えさせて！", "zh": "呜……好、好啦……\n那我再联络你！先给我点时间想想吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_001_2006_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_001_2007_p", "source_sha256": "a5c0f256e2ca465a8550881a0be3e523c9de0445a3462e255d5a900b1e2ef791", "ja": "（あれから3日。昴が初めて会った場所に\n来てくれって連絡くれたけど……）", "zh": "（后来又过了三天，昴跟我联络了，\n要我过来第一次见面的这个地方……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_001_2008_047sub", "source_sha256": "5948d40680868e1bc0e4f2547ce2a02dfe237d44e2fb206203017544e43c9b01", "ja": "お～い！　こっちだよ、{$P$}！\nわざわざ来てくれて、ありがとな！", "zh": "喂～！我在这边，{$P$}！\n谢谢你专程跑过来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_001_2009_047sub", "source_sha256": "fd5245edd9da966e99bc8f90d035221ca68d4879fc0fcf7ac186c67e37afb6d5", "ja": "実はさ、この間のアイドルになるって話を家族に\n相談したら……やってみたらって言われたんだ！", "zh": "是这样的，我这几天和家人商量要不要当偶像……\n结果他们要我尝试看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_001_2010_p", "source_sha256": "2405be1a4c3d28183ad5a9cdfe5e85c6ac054804392d2cd02172aa3143826c2e", "ja": "ということは、なってくれるのか？　嬉しいよ！\nでも、電話での連絡でもよかったのに。", "zh": "所以说，你愿意来当偶像啰？太棒了！\n不过，其实你打电话告知我就行啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_001_2011_047sub", "source_sha256": "3e53956103f4371eb1361e66038a3bcb6fe927a98c9047bce3a2ccd1997c3355", "ja": "でも、これってすげー大事なことだろ？\nだから直接会って、伝えた方がいいと思ったんだ！", "zh": "可是，这是超级重要的事情不是吗？\n所以我觉得还是当面讲比较好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_001_2012_047sub", "source_sha256": "5780d1a76c5889e299868793dd4c37c6cfe3a1d92de42e352a1c4e89947bf05e", "ja": "{$P$}、改めて言うけど……\nオレ、アイドルになるよ！　これからよろしくな！", "zh": "{$P$}，我郑重宣布……\n我要当偶像！以后还请多指教喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_001_2013_p", "source_sha256": "3399f3943871560a81189b855b36116894de6d6014b0335ac06d98a94818a54d", "ja": "（すごく律儀なんだな……うん！\nこの子なら、きっと成功できる気がするぞ……！）", "zh": "（好有礼貌……很好！\n我觉得这孩子一定能够成功……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
